# Telemetry Ingestion API

## Overview

This project is a Node.js + Express based Telemetry Ingestion API designed to receive, store, and process telemetry data from devices or services. The system is built using a clean layered architecture with separation of concerns between routes, controllers, services, and database models.

The API exposes an endpoint to ingest telemetry data and returns a success status when data is received correctly.

---

## Tech Stack

- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB
- Mongoose (ODM)
- dotenv (Environment Variables)
- Nodemon (Development)

---

